  "recipe": {
    "technique": "Production of traditional Inabel weaving is still prevalent among Ilocano provinces and is one of its One-Town, One Product or simply known as OTOP. It includes Bangar in La Union; Candon City, Santiago, Santa, Bantay, and Vigan City in Ilocos Sur; La Paz and Bangued in Abra; and Pinili, Paoay, and Sarrat in Ilocos Norte, amidst challenges such as lack of raw materials, manpower, and advanced technology that provide mass-produced textiles."
  },
